From e14b425cb7024cbe6f336fbb217f72d52c9e735c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Connor Abbott <cwabbott0@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 12:00:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tu: Correctly set speculatability

Determine from the Vulkan descriptor set information whether descriptor
loads can be speculated and whether SSBO/UBO/texture loads can be
speculated. This has no impact yet, but will once ir3 starts relying on
producers for speculatability.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/42159>
(cherry picked from mesa main commit e14b425cb7024cbe6f336fbb217f72d52c9e735c)
